          "label": "Verso, address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>To the precious glory, our companion and our beloved, (his) h(onor), g(reatness, and) h(oliness), son of Rabbi Shemarya the teacher, may he rest in Eden,\n<p></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>our master and teacher Efrayim the \u1e24aver, may our Rock preserve him. Great salvation.</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
